WEBVTT

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:17.350
Then Jolyne got punished on purpose
so that she gets confined

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:20.310
at the Disciplinary Wing to find the bone!

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:21.390
Yes.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:26.770
If I successfully protect her to the end,
then I will marry her.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.310
This is my condition.

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:30.070
Got that?

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.490
Diver Drive!

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:44.500
Give us your blessing.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:49.540
The electric potential sending
signals to the nervous system

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.760
is very small, at 70mV.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.630
This Stand dwells in
that slight pulse of energy.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:01:00.010
Survivor's attack is mostly unnoticed,
and it doesn't cause any harm.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.270
It simply awakens its victim's anger.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:40.740
EPISODE 16: THE SECRET OF GUARD WESTWOOD

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:54.290
Bastards!

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.960
I can see

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:02.680
the strongest parts
of each fighter's body from here!

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.310
It's Fight Club time!

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:08.180
Let's brawl!

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:23.660
I've always found you irritating, fuckers!

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:29.330
The enemy User must be among them.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:34.040
One of them manipulated
the guards into fighting.

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:39.130
The bone lurking somewhere within
this Ultra Security House Unit…

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:41.130
I'll do anything it takes to make it mine!

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:44.550
I won't let anyone stand in my way.

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.510
If anyone dares, I will kill--

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.930
Hold on… kill?

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:53.770
Did I really think that just now?

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:56.610
This burning feeling awakening within me…

00:03:57.110 --> 00:04:00.030
Is this my fighting spirit?
It urges me to conquer all

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:03.400
no matter who I'm up against
or what happens to me.

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:04.990
Why do I feel so aggressive?

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.620
This prison guard…

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:16.790
Now, he wants to do to me
what he did to the other guard.

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:20.760
But that's fine.
He's no match for my Stone Ocean.

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:37.060
Stone Ocean!

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:53.910
I can see it, FE40536.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.540
I can see your strongest point.

00:04:55.620 --> 00:05:00.500
It's the thread-like thing
coming out of your muscles.

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:02.420
It's beautiful.

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:05.260
So that's your strongest power.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.470
His movements just now…

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:13.310
Though his fight with the other guard
was uncanny and brutal,

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:15.600
it was still just a brawl.

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:17.020
But now,

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:20.190
his movements are beyond
what humans can do!

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:24.610
I have to defeat him with all my power
as fast as I can!

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.500
The guard's muscles…

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.500
They are shining beautifully.

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:41.710
Also, the sequence
of his movements just now…

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:45.260
How is a human capable
of ignoring fear and pain

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.970
to exert that much force
when attacking and jumping?

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:51.850
But if the beautiful lights
emanating from his muscles

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:55.220
indicate his strongest parts,

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:58.390
then that leg of his right now…

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:00.810
That's the leg I attacked.

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:02.730
My attack was effective!

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:03.940
I can feel it.

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.360
I can tell that my attack
did some deep damage to his leg!

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:11.660
Bastard.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:14.580
Who said you can walk in front of me?

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.410
You're pissing me off!

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.710
The others have started fighting too.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.880
Take this!

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.090
Damn prison guard!

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:31.590
I must incapacitate him as quickly
as I can and focus on finding the bone!

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:44.940
Good thing you didn't wring your own neck

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:46.190
with that swing of yours.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.410
Now, just stay there!

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:14.550
What the hell just happened?

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:16.350
How did he attack me?

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:19.310
This prison guard!

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:21.020
What did you do just now?

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.520
This is…

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:27.690
So he is also a Stand User.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:31.030
There's more than one User
in this Disciplinary Wing.

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:35.490
He already had a Stand on a disc!

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:39.700
But what did he do, and how?

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:43.540
I left him no chance to counter me.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:48.050
And I didn't see his Stand,
so how did he attack me?

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:49.880
It's deep.

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.720
Fuck, it's deep.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:56.680
He can't leave a wound this deep
with a stashed razor blade or a knife.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:58.930
Just what did he do to me?

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:06.360
If he has a power-type Stand,
then I should be able to see it!

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:09.070
FE40536.

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:10.820
You use threads to attack.

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:15.360
I see threads
and a bundle of them in your body.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:19.870
Your strongest power comes
from using this ability.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:21.750
That's what makes you strong.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:24.710
How beautiful.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:28.460
I can see your shine.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:34.880
When did you become a Stand User?

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.470
Yesterday?

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:37.550
Or a moment ago?

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:51.030
I saw it!

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:53.610
I saw his Stand!

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:56.200
His Stand took form!

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:01.240
A Stand User…

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:07.040
So this bastard is the assassin
sent to eliminate me.

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:12.550
Strings do not require power to defend.

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:17.430
A punch's straight trajectory
can easily be changed

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.510
by throwing it off by just a little.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:23.560
Right into my trap.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:27.810
Now that you've used both of your arms,
I can restrict all your movements.

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:30.190
In other words…

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:38.860
you'll get covered with my jacket.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:39.990
Stone Ocean!

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.000
I won't let you get back up.

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.260
Wha… what?

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:03.260
It's happening again!

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:06.930
What does his Stand do?

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.650
No, I can't see it! What did it do?

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:12.980
I have you now!

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:17.740
You're just a piece of shit.

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:21.200
You've made a fool out of me.

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:23.030
How dare you.

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:25.790
Prisoners are the scum of society.

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:30.370
Nothing infuriates me more than
scum like you treating me like shit.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:34.840
I spent every day on duty
irritated like this.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:36.260
How dare you look down on me.

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:38.670
I'll make you pay.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:40.260
I'm not holding back anymore!

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:41.970
I'll release my anger now.

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:43.930
I won't hold anything back.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:46.850
I'll make sure you pay.

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:48.060
I am the strongest!

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:54.400
I'm going crazy,
and you're going to get it!

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:00.400
What's that on the ceiling window?

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.740
No, so his Stand is…

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:05.030
This isn't good!

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.330
At this rate, I'll be…

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.870
I have to get away!

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:12.880
His Stand's attack is coming towards me!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:15.960
I got you now.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:17.210
I've completely locked you in.

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:25.930
Did you forget that I'm a prison guard?

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:29.730
I detain prisoners
almost every day at my job.

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:32.440
Your right hand may seem to be free,

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:37.360
but this headlock does more than choke.

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:40.900
I'm also twisting the joint
on your left shoulder

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:45.450
so that your right arm goes dead
and doesn't rise.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:50.040
Your right hand won't reach my face.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:56.290
This headlock has one weakness,
which I know very well.

00:11:57.590 --> 00:12:01.880
Your right hand is free to grab my balls.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:04.840
Of course, I wouldn't mind that
if the situation were different.

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:09.390
But I can even block that too!

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:13.600
It's coming!

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:18.570
If I don't do something,
his Stand's true form will…

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:20.280
That ceiling!

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:24.160
The ceiling window's hard glass…

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:25.740
Those cracks!

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:28.700
I have to break free!

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:30.410
Stone Ocean!

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:33.580
I tore his eardrum!

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:35.250
His grip loosened!

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:41.090
The universe is full of countless
space rocks and debris.

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:45.930
Many of such rocks are drawn in
by the gravitational pull of the earth.

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:50.600
While the majority disintegrate
before reaching the surface,

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:51.770
what if the meteorites

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:56.350
could retain optimal angle and speed
while entering the atmosphere?

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:09.910
STAND NAME: STARLIGHT WAVES
STAND MASTER: VIVIANO WESTWOOD

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:38.310
Oh, so you're coming too.

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:40.770
I can do this by myself.

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:44.780
I make and call the shots around here.

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:50.030
Yes, I asked for your help,
but let's make that clear.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:57.830
Also, if Pale Snake really is determined
to eliminate Jolyne,

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:02.920
he must have sent two assassins,
no, even more than that.

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:06.590
There must be at least
three Stand Users after Jolyne's life.

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:12.430
You and I will get rid of them,
then meet back here.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:13.470
Got that?

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:15.720
Fine.

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:20.980
I plan to be back
before that guard wakes up.

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:26.940
Also, we already agreed that
I'll marry Jolyne.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.200
Don't forget that.

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:34.160
Yeah, so about that…

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:37.080
What the hell do you mean?
I really don't get you.

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:03.690
Meteorites!

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:09.190
His attacks are the meteorites
that are drawn to this prison guard!

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:11.360
That's what was smashing into me.

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:15.370
His Stand attracts meteorites from space.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:19.830
But they always
burn away before they can hit him.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:23.380
And another one will fall.
He'll attract another one!

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:24.590
Before that happens…

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.050
I got you!

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:32.300
This time, I won't let go!

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:35.800
I'll be the victor, shining beautifully.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:39.520
I am the strongest!

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.230
Stone Ocean!

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:52.400
I'll strip off your skin from toe to head!

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:57.870
Now let me go, you fucking guard!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.380
He loosened his grip!

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.430
I barely dodged them.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:26.810
I tried to deflect the meteorites
toward him,

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.110
but it's just like the last time.

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:33.320
Not a single meteorite will hit him.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:36.200
They disintegrate the moment
before they hit him!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:40.540
That prison guard's Stand ability

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:45.500
attracts the falling meteorites
toward his body like a magnet!

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:48.880
But no matter what I try,

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:54.300
the meteorites hit only me
when I get close to him.

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:56.640
How bizarre.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:17:00.760
Burning rocks are falling
toward me from the sky.

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:03.270
Are they meteorites?

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:05.270
Could this be my strongest power?

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.770
FE40536.

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:11.940
How many of them have smashed into you?

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:13.690
Your wounds look serious.

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:19.830
They got both your arms,
your left ribs, and your right leg.

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:21.620
So that's five times.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:23.080
Or is that six?

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:28.380
The next one will be your fatal blow.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:38.720
What a bluff.

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:43.640
You are barely able to stand right now.

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:47.810
Not even, you are just trying
to fool me with that stance.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:54.490
In truth, you can't fight me
with those arms anymore.

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:59.700
Your arm muscles are pitch-black.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:03.160
The muscles have really lost their shine.

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.910
Why don't we fool around a bit?

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:10.960
Let's see how bad your damage is.

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:16.880
What's the matter?

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:19.970
Come on, give me a swing.

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:21.760
I'm not even blocking.

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:24.810
Here, attack me.

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:27.230
How do you want to punch me?

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:30.270
I'll even close my eyes for you.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:38.900
Over there!

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:41.240
That little thing he's got.

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:44.200
That's the bone Pale Snake is after!

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:47.160
That's the bone! It's right over there!

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:52.540
You can't even fight anymore!

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:57.510
You are using the wall
to block the meteorites.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:01.260
I knew you'd try that!

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:05.640
Meteorites were already
crashing towards me

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:07.980
from the other side of the wall!

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:15.860
I won!

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:21.530
I knew it, you are so damaged
that you can't even block my blows!

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:25.530
One stared at the wall

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:31.000
While the other looked up at the stars
On the other side of the bars

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:34.630
Which am I?

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:38.630
And now, one more hit!

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:41.340
The bone is right over there.

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:46.600
I will do anything
to get close to Pale Snake.

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.100
I'll even drink sewage water.

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:52.060
I'll even become the strongest!

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:56.980
I win!

00:19:57.770 --> 00:20:03.320
There's no way for you
to escape the meteorite now!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.570
Of course, I want to look up at the stars.

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:10.500
I want to keep looking at them
until I see Dad again.

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:14.460
Good grief.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:17.170
Here comes your final blow!

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:20.210
You're done for!

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:23.470
I can't dodge this final blow.

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:27.760
I can't block it with Stone Ocean anymore.

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:32.270
I am superior!

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:33.520
But…

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:37.480
I did manage to slip off your right shoe.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:49.030
She even put a brick in my boot!

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:53.500
She took the hit,
but the damage was halved!

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.670
She changed its course!

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:02.670
The meteorite will disintegrate.

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:05.050
It's impossible to hit you with it.

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:08.600
I'm strictly speaking about
the meteorite, that is.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:10.810
My boot!

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:19.520
Seriously, good grief.

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:24.990
You bitch!

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:26.110
Stone Ocean!

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:37.420
What is up with this bitch?

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:39.880
She really doesn't give up.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.300
She doesn't give up at all.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.970
Dammit.

00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:48.760
Yes, if the meteorite collides
into something else first,

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:51.140
then she can hit me with it.

00:21:51.220 --> 00:21:53.600
How terrible.

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:57.390
How dare she do
such a terrible thing against me.

00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:59.190
This woman…

00:22:01.770 --> 00:22:03.440
I choose to look up at the stars.

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:13.660
Match over!

00:23:41.330 --> 00:23:46.340
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
